      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Saurabh, and this is week two with brutalist dot art. Same note as last time. The voice you are hearing is generated. The work is mine. Last week I used the toolkit. This week I opened it up.",
